msgstr "Úspešne automaticky pridelené rozhodcovia/rozhodkyne na debaty."

#: adjallocation/consumers.py:141
msgid "There aren't any panels to fill. Create panels first."
msgstr "Nie sú žiadne panely na doplnenie. Najprv vytvor panely."

#: adjallocation/consumers.py:165
#, python-format
msgid "Successfully auto-allocated adjudicators to preformed panels. However, there was a warning:"
msgid_plural "Successfully auto-allocated adjudicators to preformed panels. However, there were %(count)d warnings:"
msgstr[0] "Úspešne automaticky pridelené rozhodcovia/rozhodkyne na preformuláred panels. avšak, there bolo upozornenie:"
